# Vitest policy

- Colocate `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx` next to the module under test.
- Mock `fetch`, Mapbox, and service ports; no live Mapbox API calls in unit tests.
- Prefer narrow runs: `pnpm --filter web exec vitest run <path>`.
- Update tests when UI copy or behavior changes; assert behavior, not implementation details.
